Package: CaPri
Title: Bayesian Mendelian Randomization with Potentially Pleiotropic Instruments
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ou", "Ren", , "oren4@wisc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bayesian Mendelian randomization using GWAS summary statistics
    that jointly estimates the causal effect of an exposure on an outcome and
    the direct pleiotropic effects of genetic instruments, using variational
    inference.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/OuRen0104/CaPri
BugReports: https://github.com/OuRen0104/CaPri/issues
Imports: 
    graphics,
    utils
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
LazyData: true
Encoding: UTF-8
